OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers told 'not too late' to
OL,4,Afight virus outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeak District farmers are being told
OL,7,F"it's not too late to vaccinate" as
OL,8,Fcases of bluetongue virus pass 1,000
OL,9,Fnationwide.
OL,11,FGovernment figures show 1,132 confirmed
OL,12,Fcases of the insect-borne viral disease
OL,13,Faffecting sheep and cattle have been
OL,14,Fconfirmed in the 2026-27 season.
OL,16,FOrganisers of Derbyshire's Dovedale
OL,17,FSheepdog Trials cancelled the 2026
OL,18,Fevent in August "in respect of the
OL,19,Fspread of this devastating virus".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
