OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers told 'not too late' to
OL,4,Afight virus outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAHDB is hosting an event at Bakewell
OL,7,FAuction Mart on Monday to give farmers
OL,8,Fthe chance to find out more about
OL,9,Fvaccination and other support available
OL,10,Ffrom experts.
